# Is file ko copy karke ".env" naam ki file banayein (isi signature-api
# folder me) aur neeche apni asal PostgreSQL connection string likhein.
# Neon par: Dashboard -> apna project -> "Connect" -> Connection string.
#
# KHABARDAR: asal .env file me database ka password hota hai.
# Ye file kisi ko bhejni ya GitHub/Jira par upload NAHI karni.
#
# DATABASE_URL wali line hi na ho (ya khaali ho) to backend purani tarah
# SQLite (app.db) par chalta hai — data isi PC par rehta hai.

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USERNAME:PASSWORD@HOST/DBNAME?sslmode=require
